# "Rather than pay <subject>'s mana cost, you may <cost>": `altCost` with its subject printed first,
# as *Invigorate* prints it [CR#118.9].
# TODO(spelling): Spell `payingInstead(<cost>)` here as "<cost>".
template ratherThanPay(subject: NounPhrase, cost: AltCost): StaticSpec {
  body = altCost($cost, $subject)
}
